{"code":"q8","title":"您的身高属于？","type":"single","role":"assessment","section":"身体形态","options":[{"code":"a","label":"比同性/同种或大多数人明显更高 - 男＞175；女＞165"},{"code":"b","label":"比同性/同种或大多数人明显更矮 - 男＜170；女＜155"},{"code":"c","label":"中间水平，不高也不矮 - 男 170-175；女 155-165"}],"required":true,"hint":"","unit":"","prefill":null,"screenGroup":null,"multiline":false,"confidence":"confident"},
